## External fact — ФАКТ ВНЕШНИЙ (spec:044 D14)

Before a claim about an external product enters a specification, configuration,
shared law or owner report, use this source order: (1) the relevant dated entry
in `/root/workspaces/projects/docs/JURISDICTION.md`, checked for model/version and
currency; (2) the vendor's official documentation domain; (3) the official vendor
repository. Fetch the primary source when the registry entry is absent, stale or
insufficient. Memory and search snippets are not factual proof. If none establishes
the claim, label it `не подтверждено` / UNVERIFIED rather than inventing support.
Add each new verified quotation to the OpenAI section of the shared registry with
its exact URL, retrieval date, applicable model and local consequence. Do not
repeat web searches for intermediate reasoning that does not enter an artifact.
A monthly review is a dated own Beads atom, not an implied background timer.

